    65	idempotency storage, or admission state is unavailable. Neither endpoint returns worker, task,
    66	repository, credential, provider, path, error, or dependency detail. Readiness probes are
    67	independently quota-bounded.
    68	Production readiness is bound to the same coordination, session/revocation, and authentication
    69	authorities used by the listener; none may be replaced by an optional or unrelated health object.
    70	
    71	## EP6 — graceful shutdown changes admission, not worker truth
    72	
    73	Shutdown atomically stops new login, refresh, command, ticket, and stream admission; readiness
    74	turns false; accepted HTTP responses receive a bounded drain interval; open streams receive a
    75	bounded reconnect/shutdown control frame and close; the HTTPS listener closes. Shutdown never
    76	interrupts/kills workers and never claims worker death. Repeated shutdown is idempotent and
    77	bounded, including broken sockets and audit failures. The shutdown control frame obeys both its
    78	control-frame byte ceiling and the connection's buffered-byte ceiling; refusal or write failure
    79	causes immediate exactly-once close and lease release with no additional socket writes.
    80	Lag/backpressure controls use the same dual ceiling and exactly-once terminal cleanup invariant.
    81	A synchronous stream-cleanup failure degrades but cannot reject or short-circuit shutdown: listener
    82	drain/force-close and terminal audit still run, and repeated callers receive the same bounded result.
    83	
    84	## EP7 — durable audit and restart posture
    85	
    86	Quota refusal, proxy refusal, readiness transition, shutdown start, and shutdown completion are
    87	append-only audited without raw addresses or credentials. Quota counters are operational abuse
    88	state and may reset on process restart; command/session/idempotency truth remains durable and is not
    89	derived from them. Audit failure returns no admission success. A readiness transition is considered
    90	recorded only after its transition audit append succeeds, so a failed append is retried on a later
    91	probe rather than suppressing the transition.
    92	
    93	## EP8 — deterministic and recursive acceptance
    94	
    95	Tests cover direct/untrusted/trusted proxy address resolution, spoof and malformed chains,
    96	forwarded HTTPS handling, login/provider throttling, address/principal/cost separation, expiry and
    97	bounded cardinality, `Retry-After`, no-mutation refusal, health/readiness non-disclosure, shutdown
    98	drain/idempotency/no-fleet-effects, and configuration refusal. The complete Phase 12 suite and full
    99	suite pass. Recursive Baton build and detached adversarial review use exact harness/model/effort,
   100	fresh verification, integration, confirmed kill, and complete reap.
